4,Sierra Puebla Nahuatl - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sierra_Puebla_Nahuatl,"December 3, 2025 - Sierra Puebla Nahuatl is one of the Eastern Peripheral varieties of Nahuatl, spoken by ethnic Nahua people in northwestern Puebla state in Mexico. The following description is that of the Sierra Puebla dialects: /t, n, l/ may also freely be heard as dental [t̪, n̪, l̪] among dialects.","Nahuatl, Central Puebla",Uto-Aztecan
