8,"Nahuatl, Northern Oaxaca",https://accentnetwork.com/nahuatl-northern-oaxaca/,"April 22, 2025 - Northern Puebla Nahuatl includes nasalized sounds and tonal distinctions, challenging for outsiders. Primarily follows VSO, with tones marking different grammatical aspects. Text tends to expand by around 10%, impacting subtitle alignment. Respectful terms and cultural expressions are complex to translate. Compatibility with diacritical fonts is essential for readability. Northern Puebla culture is rich in stories, music, and ceremonial events.","Nahuatl, Central Puebla",Uto-Aztecan
